"""Self-test of the return validator: a gate that cannot fail is not a gate.

Every check id is exercised on input that must trip it — with the SEVERITY it must carry,
because RED versus GREEN is the validator's whole product — and the golden returns must
produce no finding at all. Hermetic: each case builds its own fixture project in a temp
directory. The only thing taken from the real repository is the journey gate script,
because the point is to prove the validator against the gate projects actually run.
"""

